# Cursor — REF-RFX Agent

Read [`INSTRUCTIONS.md`](../../INSTRUCTIONS.md) before taking any action in this repository.

Skills are available in `.cursor/skills/`, registered as `ref-rfx-` prefixed Agent Skills (e.g. `ref-rfx-deliberate`). Invoke one explicitly by typing `/ref-rfx-<step>` in chat (e.g. `/ref-rfx-catalogue`) — they do not auto-trigger from ambient context.

Skills are backlog-aware — invoke a skill without arguments to work on the current active item, or pass an explicit item number to target a specific item (e.g. `/ref-rfx-deliberate item-03`).
